{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PHL sits on 2,370 acres of land and has seven terminals with four separate runways at PHL serving the 7th-largest metropolitan area in the United States.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Realistic modeling with over 100 custom modelled buildings.<br>\u2013 Detailed ground polygon model including taxiway bridges<br>\u2013 Updated selection of Radar screens.<br>\u2013 Modelled Taxi signs.<br>\u2013 Updated taxi light models that follow the curve of the lines and wigwag lights placed at runway entrances.<br>\u2013 Dynamic runway approach lighting with runway sequenced flashers.<br>\u2013 Beautiful background cityscape from OSM (open street maps).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fifteen major airlines (and several connection brands) service travelers at PHL. PHL is the primary international hub of US Airways. Southwest Airlines and US Airways are the largest competitors at PHL. Over 30,000 passengers travel through the airport each year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632920/extras/KPHL4.jpg?t=1744277266\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Philadelphia International Airport has six terminals with a total of 126 gates. Non pre-cleared international arrivals are processed in Terminal A. The B/C connector and Terminal F.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632920/extras/KPHL6.jpg?t=1744277266\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terminal A is divided into two sections, east and west. Terminal A West has 13 gates, while Terminal A East has 11 gates. Terminals B and C have 15 and 14 gates respectively. They are the two main terminals used by American.\u00a0Terminal D has 16 gates; E has 17 gates and F terminal has 38 gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632920?t=1744277266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632920/50319d103a6a5f8c147efab542644f040a8e1e9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744277266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632920/6e566bf00f083411d96de26b82725d95b4a6fb48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744277266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632920/6e566bf00f083411d96de26b82725d95b4a6fb48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744277266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PHL sits on 2,370 acres of land and has seven terminals with four separate runways at PHL serving the 7th-largest metropolitan area in the United States.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Realistic modeling with over 100 custom modelled buildings.<br>\u2013 Detailed ground polygon model including taxiway bridges<br>\u2013 Updated selection of Radar screens.<br>\u2013 Modelled Taxi signs.<br>\u2013 Updated taxi light models that follow the curve of the lines and wigwag lights placed at runway entrances.<br>\u2013 Dynamic runway approach lighting with runway sequenced flashers.<br>\u2013 Beautiful background cityscape from OSM (open street maps).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fifteen major airlines (and several connection brands) service travelers at PHL. PHL is the primary international hub of US Airways. Southwest Airlines and US Airways are the largest competitors at PHL. Over 30,000 passengers travel through the airport each year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632920/extras/KPHL4.jpg?t=1744277266\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Philadelphia International Airport has six terminals with a total of 126 gates. Non pre-cleared international arrivals are processed in Terminal A. The B/C connector and Terminal F.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632920/extras/KPHL6.jpg?t=1744277266\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terminal A is divided into two sections, east and west. Terminal A West has 13 gates, while Terminal A East has 11 gates. Terminals B and C have 15 and 14 gates respectively. They are the two main terminals used by American.\u00a0Terminal D has 16 gates; E has 17 gates and F terminal has 38 gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["FeelThere"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2176130","name":"Tower! Simulator 3"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632920/a726ca82ffb2be4cf20f6ac3bd1c42d3ddba0f2a/header.jpg?t=1744277266","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Tower! Simulator 3 - KPHL Airport","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"de